// stimulus.hex - rinriAI arch/golden_model (inputs confirmed correct,
// 2026-08-20 frontend verdict; only the 6th sample was appended)
// $readmemh-loadable input for the fe-rtl Verilog testbench (one word/line).
// Layout (60 words):
//   Section 1, words 0..29:  initial weights/biases, address order 0..29,
//                            each a 16-bit Q8.8 word (4 hex digits).
//   Section 2, words 30..59: 6 samples; per sample 5 bytes (2 hex digits):
//                            pixel[0..3] then label byte.  Matches the
//                            sample_stream framing (FEATURES pixels + label).
//   Sample 6 (words 55..59): pixels 00 01 02 03, label 05 - INVALID label
//                            (>= CLASSES=2): REQ-018 rejection proof; the
//                            model/RTL must reject it (err, not counted).
// Values are value-identical to golden_model_test_vectors.h for words 0..54.
